| Wuji as pre-settlement territory | "Liquid, underdetermined information" prior to "glassy" settlement (Source 11 ¬ß2) | SEP "Religious Daoism"; SEP "Chinese Metaphysics" (wuji-taiji pairing, **Song**, Zhou Dunyi ‚Äî not Ming) | Undifferentiated ground as gloss on pre-settlement territory | **[METAPHOR]**, stacked on an already-flagged unproved physics metaphor | Source 11 itself flags the liquid/glassy language as unproved research interpretation; stacking a second unproved figure does not add rigor |

