## Closing synthesis

The Autonomous National Territory is not the directory tree. It is the
recurring capacity of distinct local languages to settle from admitted
evidence, preserve protected difference, transact across explicit borders,
remember their acts, and continue without a capital impersonating their
missing functions.

The Sovereign State Enterprise is useful provisional Leader language for the
local bearer of that capacity. Its public operational name may need to be
**sovereign settlement enterprise** to avoid confusion with state-owned
corporations and legal sovereignty. The name is not earned until at least one
such settlement passes the autonomy test.

The immediate missing capacity is not another solid organizational artifact.
It is the memorializing phase transition by which a dense human utterance can
become many attributable, contractable, and sometimes contradictory fibers
without one model silently becoming the state. This note preserves the
recognition. A living implementation must make the same transformation
independently callable, witnessed, revisable, and capable of refusal.
