The quotient face (`bernoulli_split`/`bernoulli_total`/
`bernoulli_vershik`) carries only the Bishop stack's standing debt (the
setoid's `equiv_trans` goes through `iring`). Blueprint:
`thm:bernoulli-cylinder-law`, `thm:bernoulli-vershik-invariant` green;
`thm:odometer-stage-unique-ergodicity` red. The coin-flipping measure as
the odometer's invariant law, derived, certified ‚Äî census item 1, closed.

Debt discharged at the source en route: `Real.Internal.int_mul_pos`
hand-built axiom-free and swapped into `PreRat.add`/`PreRat.mul`
`den_pos` (was core `Int.mul_pos`, propext) ‚Äî every theorem that so much
as MENTIONS pre-rational arithmetic lost that taint, because `#print
axioms` traverses structure proof fields (¬ß7's instance-audit pitfall,
now also a repair pattern: audit the def, fix at the source).

Technique bank (each earned the hard way this session): **`Int.ofNat` is
DEFINITIONALLY a semiring hom on + and √ó**, so PreRat cross-multiplication
identities `show`-reduce to pure Nat identities ‚Äî prove there. Clean core
Nat lemmas: `one_mul`, `mul_one`, `mul_two`, `two_mul`, `mul_comm`,
`left_distrib`, `pow_succ`, `two_pow_pos`, `succ_sub_one`; TAINTED:
`Nat.add_mul`, `Nat.mul_assoc`, `Int.ofNat_lt`. Int positivity without
