`iring` is AC-rewriting only ‚Äî it cannot collect `d + d`; route additive
collection through Nat.

### 8.2 The program: probability as four verbs on the path-space site

The operator's frame, endorsed: probability organized around compatible
laws of **evolution, observation, conditioning, and intervention on
spaces of paths**. The structural coincidence that makes it this
library's subject (reading, with its proved anchors named): the
Kolmogorov extension theorem ‚Äî a process exists iff its finite-
dimensional laws are compatible ‚Äî IS an inverse-limit gluing statement,
and the tree has already proved the gluing dichotomy in the order-valued
coefficient (`tower_gluing_dichotomy`, `hull_settling_gluing_dichotomy`).
`CylinderLaw` is the same site with ADDITIVE compatibility: two
coefficient disciplines, one site, bridged by the proved dequantization
hom `supp` ‚Äî the support of an additive law is an order datum; martingales
tropicalize to settling data. Second founding reading, rhyming with ¬ß1:
**normalization is a compactification.** Total mass one is what bounds
the coefficient carrier; bounded is what glues; the record carrier's
toplessness is what escapes. "Probability measures extend where
unnormalized measures need not" and "FOUR is initial exactly where bounds
exist" are one phenomenon. Target theorem: constructive Kolmogorov on the
profinite hull ‚Äî every `CylinderLaw` glues to a finitely-additive law on
the cylinder algebra, decidably (compactness is combinatorial per depth);
the record-valued escape is the proved counterpoint.

Per verb (theorem-shapes, each marked):

- **EVOLVE.** Kernels as tower data; needed: the row-stochastic bundle
  (retires the `Stochastic.lean` overclaim) and Chapman‚ÄìKolmogorov as
  associativity of kernel composition ‚Äî evolution as a monoid action on
  laws. Reading worth building toward: the law of large numbers is an
  œâ-regime settling statement ‚Äî the average settles but NO finite stage
  attains it ‚Äî i.e. the LLN has exactly the structure
  `unattained_settling_gate` prices. Conjecture: the Kolmogorov 0‚Äì1 law
  as corner collapse ‚Äî on the tail, FOUR-valued readings settle into the
  Boolean corners.
- **OBSERVE.** No œÉ-algebras, ever: the tower IS the filtration (design
  judgment, per ¬ß9's "absence" discipline). New object: conditional
  expectation `E_n f (w) = (f(w0) + f(w1))/2` ‚Äî laws are covariant (mass
  splits down, = `CylinderLaw.split`), observables contravariant (values
  average up). The tower property `E_m ‚àò E_n = E_{min}` is an ep-pair law
  (the `valueEP` conjugation pattern of ¬ß7c, with averaging in place of
  eval-at-‚ä•‚Çñ). Martingale = additive-compatible observable thread.
  Conjectures: Doob convergence as settling of the martingale closure;
  the upcrossing count as a cycle/cocycle count priced √† la coordination
  cohomology.
- **CONDITION.** Conditioning on cylinder w = restriction to the subtree
  at w + renormalization by 1/mass(w), and the subtree IS another dyadic
  tower ‚Äî conditioning is an endomorphism of the site. Proved germs
  already in-tree: `conditioning_is_reindex`, `condMeasure_symm`,
  `conditional_via_fiber_adjoint` (counting level). Target: conditioning
  as a KZ closure on laws (idempotent, monotone in information), Bayes as
  the fiber adjunction's counit, decidable over the derived rationals.
  The house's own layer: conditioning on a null cylinder yields held ‚ä•
  (no division-by-zero convention); merging incompatible conditionals
  yields held ‚ä§ with priced mass. THE UNIFICATION (reading, with the
  proved anchor): an empirical model is a compatible family of
  conditionals with no joint ‚Äî **strong contextuality is conditioning's
  gluing failure**; the PR box is a Bayes crisis. The weld theorem to
  covet: the PR conditionals admit no global law, and the minimum ‚ä§-mass
  of a paraconsistent joint is the proved ground-state energy
  (`record_merge_ground_state`). Plus the FOURTH currency for ¬ß4's
  exchange web (conjecture): by Abramsky‚ÄìBrandenburger every
  no-signalling model has a SIGNED joint; minimum total negative mass =
  a fourth price beside cycle rank, record mass, and the vertex-cover
  norm. Negative probability = ‚ä§-mass in the signed coefficient ring.
  Only this tree can prove that exchange, because only this tree has the
  other three prices as theorems.
- **INTERVENE.** do(x) replaces the kernel at a site with a point mass
  and pushes forward; see(x) filters paths; they differ exactly through
  confounding ‚Äî a statement about the CAUSAL ORDER, and the tree owns
  causal sets and causal cohomology. Program: kernels indexed by a finite
  causal set; the confounded triangle with do ‚â† see, decidable; the
  back-door criterion as section existence over a sub-cover; conjecture:
  the do/see gap is a cocycle, plausibly in the image of the six-term
  LES's connecting map (which fires exactly at irreversible settling
  steps ‚Äî and intervention is an irreversible act on the tower). No
  proof assistant has do-calculus at all; none anywhere has it
  obstruction-shaped. The priced version ‚Äî minimum ‚ä§-mass to reconcile
  interventional with observational data, the cost of confounding in
  bits ‚Äî would be a new invariant in the literature outright.

### 8.3 The program matrix

Every verb is parameterized by the coefficient semiring (¬ß11's
