O-minimality deliberately absent from the bets: it is the foil, not
the target.

## 9. Infrastructure we do not have ‚Äî and how to EARN it

The census against Mathlib found four adoption-blocking absences: ‚ÑÇ,
topology, a polynomial API, Finset. Absence is a design judgment (house
law), and importing any of them would violate no-free-data anyway ‚Äî so
each must arrive in-chain or not at all. Conjectured derivations, each
with an existing trailhead in the tree:

- **‚ÑÇ from the quarter-turn.** `negSwap` has order 4 with square
  `negConf` (theorem, `D4Gauge`); the charge diamond already carries J
  with J¬≤ = ‚àí1. Conjecture: ‚ÑÇ = the Bishop-real plane with the D‚ÇÑ
  quarter-turn as multiplication by i ‚Äî earned when the J-orbit is
  welded to `RReal` pairs and the ring laws are proved. This is what
  the reading-ladder rung "trace-interval ‚Üí circle pair" and the
  Artin‚ÄìMazur spectra ("modulus 1") are waiting on. ‚ÑÇ here would not
  be posited; it would be the charge symmetry acting on the completed
  value carrier.
- **Topology from settling.** The tree already proves Alexandrov
  recovery (`causal_alexandrov_recovers_cones`: specialization order =
  causal order) and owns the profinite cylinder structure of the hull
  (`hull_separated_by_stages`, `CylinderDatum`). Conjecture: the
  library's topology is Alexandrov/Scott topology derived from its own
  orders, plus the hull's cylinder (profinite) topology ‚Äî opens as
  settling-stable predicates. General topology is not missing; it is
  latent in two proved carriers and needs stating once.
- **Polynomials from the charpoly carriers.** `StepN/Recurrence.lean`
  already has characteristic polynomials as ascending `List Int` with
  `degreeN`, `monic`, evaluation, and Cayley‚ÄìHamilton as a family
  theorem (`cayleyHamilton_vershik`). The admitted identification debt
  "no matrix the charpolys are OF" IS the missing polynomial API asking
  to exist: one owning module making list-coefficients a commutative
  ring with evaluation as a ring hom would discharge the debt and give
  Salem/Lehmer/zeta their language. The reflective `cring` normalizer
  (`RingTactic.normalize_sound`) already contains a verified normal
  form to build on.
- **Finset from the counting measure.** `SampleSpace`/`Event` (listed
  carrier + decidable indicator) is already Finset-shaped; missing is
  cardinality infrastructure (pigeonhole in general, counting under
  maps). Earning path: the counting measure IS the cardinality ‚Äî
  develop measure-algebra (image, preimage, product) and Finset arrives
  as the faithful carrier of decidable events, which the stochastic
  program (¬ß8) needs anyway. Note Ramsey is currently R(3,3) ‚â§ 6 only;
  general finite Ramsey waits on exactly this.

**The Bishop reals are the differentiated asset ‚Äî invest.** The audit
verified: `real_completeness`, `archimedean`, `mul_inv`, `sq_sqrtNat`,
`rank_nullity_general`, and the fundamental theorem of arithmetic all
carry propext/Quot.sound ONLY ‚Äî no Classical.choice anywhere ‚Äî and
rational-order facts about ‚àö5 reduce in the kernel by plain `decide`
(verified live; needs `maxRecDepth` raised). Mathlib can offer neither:
its reals are noncomputable and choice saturates everything, so its
axiom certificates are vacuous. Concrete work items: (a) the bridging
lemma lifting one decided rational inequality at one index to a `Pos`
witness on the real (a `lt_of_ratApprox_lt` shape); (b) a
normalized-rational representation so kernel `decide` scales. Those two
turn the stack into a certified-numerics tool an outsider could use.
A reflexivity worth stating plainly: treating propext and Quot.sound as
priced debt is the ‚ä§-ledger applied to the metatheory ‚Äî the library
practices its own subject on itself, and that discipline is the product.

## 10. What we have that no one else has ‚Äî and the names not yet earned

Calibrated census (checked against Mathlib, Isabelle/AFP, Coq, Agda,
Mizar to the best of current knowledge). **Likely first in any proof
assistant, already machine-checked here:**

1. **Causal set theory** ‚Äî the general Benincasa‚ÄìDowker d'Alembertian,
   M√∂bius inversion on the causal poset (`mobius_orthogonality`), the
   Ricci-scalar/BD-action identity
   (`total_ricciScalar_eq_two_bdAction`), Alexandrov recovery. No proof
   assistant has any causal set theory. The strongest claim we own; the
   continuum limit and genuine sprinkling remain the honest frontier.
2. **The constructive Tsirelson tier** 2 < 2‚àö2 < 4 on Bishop reals
   (`chsh_tsirelson_tier`), and KCBS at ‚àö5 ‚Äî analytic quantum bounds
   with meaningful axiom certificates.
3. **The dyadic odometer** with axiom-free successor, Cantor-hull
   inverse limit, and proved minimal-aperiodic dynamics ‚Äî Mathlib has
   ergodic theory but no Bratteli‚ÄìVershik/odometer systems.
4. **The unified Wilson loop** (¬ß7d) ‚Äî curvature and contextuality as
   two projections of one gauge charge, which no formalism anywhere
   has as a theorem.
5. **Formalization under inconsistency** (capability, not one theorem
   ‚Äî reading, with its theorem components green). In every other proof
   assistant an inconsistent premise set proves everything, so a
   contradictory theory/dataset/specification cannot be formalized at
   all, only avoided. Here inconsistency is a value with a price (held
   ‚ä§; `topMass`, »û¬π as its exact cost), so a contradictory object can
   be admitted as an object of study and machine-checked theorems
   proved about what its contradiction costs and where it lives. The
   blueprint already carries the computational form: gates as local
   transport rules on the held ‚ä§-mirror, computing paraconsistently
   from the contradiction without explosion (the charge-holonomy
   automaton read as a paraconsistent circuit). State this as a
   capability of the value layer, never as a single citation.

Adjacent verbatim finding (Collatz session, transcript-confirmed):
**linear forms in logarithms have never been formalized in any proof
assistant** ‚Äî Baker/Rhin territory, and the parent-barrier gap's Pad√©
log‚ÇÇ3 measure is this territory's constructive doorstep. Not claimed;
recorded as the measured distance of that frontier.

**The unearned names (a ledger, not shame ‚Äî each entry states its
price).** We rename nothing; we earn or we strike. Current debts, with
earning paths: *Landauer's principle* is presently an alias of cycle
rank ‚Äî earned when kT¬∑ln 2 is a real quantity (ln 2 via `logNat`
exists; the missing weld is an entropy inequality on an actual process,
which ¬ß8's measures make possible). *CALM* ‚Äî the file itself says the
biconditional is not witnessed; earned by proving monotone ‚ü∫
coordination-free over a real consistency model, not the lattice
conjunction. *Jeandel‚ÄìRao* is a cohomology marker, not the 11-tile
set; earned only by the tile set and its aperiodicity (and Wang-tiling
undecidability already exists in Coq/Isabelle ‚Äî even earned, not a
first). *Lehmer* is a Bool shadow (the FOUR-valued reclassification in
the RH thread is the honest repair). *Ornstein‚ÄìZernike, Debye,
Boltzmann-H* are lattice least-fixed-points with the analytics absent;
each is earned only past a Fourier/exponential layer that does not
exist yet. *CRN deficiency theory* is absent entirely ‚Äî only detailed
balance and a Petri-net Lyapunov descent exist. Until earned, these
names cite their blueprint red nodes, never the certificates (¬ß the
reading-ledger discipline).

