## 12c. The absence census beyond primes (2026-07-11, same session)

Operator-directed: which theory is woefully absent the way the primes
were ‚Äî surrounding mathematics already forced into existence
piecemeal, frontier problems secretly about it, name never said.
Verified against the tree this session.

Runner-up absences (real, but known or cheap):

- **General group theory.** No `subgroup` declaration exists anywhere;
  no Lagrange, no orbit‚Äìstabilizer, no Burnside counting. Yet gauge
  orbits/cosets carry half the headline theorems, C6 and D4 are
  bespoke carriers (identification debts by house law), and
  `gauge_orbit_equidistributes` ‚Äî ¬ß8's model for symmetry-forced
  measure ‚Äî is a special case of orbit‚Äìstabilizer + counting. The
  stochastic program is waiting on 1770.
- **Shannon entropy.** ‚àíŒ£ p log p is defined nowhere; the only
  entropy is `ReactionNetworks.entropyH`, the Lyapunov H already
  flagged as analytics-free. The metrology of information lacks its
  unit. Earning path known: ¬ß8's measures + the existing `logNat`.
- **The exponential function** ‚Äî the strategic blocker behind ¬ß10's
  unearned names; documented, not news.

**The winner: continued fractions.** The general theory is absent (no
convergent theory, no CF carrier anywhere), and the tree has already
reinvented a piece of it by hand: `Calculus/Real/GoldenLog.lean`
defines `fib`, proves **Cassini's identity**
(fib(n+2)¬∑fib(n) ‚àí fib(n+1)¬≤ = (‚àí1)‚Åø), and proves the even-index
terms of its log-ratio sequence increase, odd-index terms decrease,
evens ‚â§ odds, jaws closing at rate 1/k (`aLog_even_mono`,
`aLog_odd_anti`, `aLog_even_le_odd`, `aLog_bracket`,
`goldenLog_converges`). Read as what it is: fib(n+1)/fib(n) are the
convergents of [1;1,1,‚Ä¶] (the golden ratio); Cassini is the
convergent determinant identity p‚Çô‚Çä‚ÇÅq‚Çô‚Çã‚ÇÅ ‚àí p‚Çôq‚Çô = ¬±1 in the all-ones
case; the even-up/odd-down interlocked bracketing is the classical
convergent oscillation theorem, reproved bare-handed for one number.
`GoldenLog` is a bespoke carrier of the missing continued-fraction
API ‚Äî an identification debt in the ¬ßMethod sense.

What the general theory pays for (each with an existing trailhead):

1. **The Pad√© log‚ÇÇ3 measure is continued fractions undeclared.** The
   parent-barrier gap's 2^a-vs-3^b separation is governed exactly by
   the convergents of log‚ÇÇ3; the record near-misses are its
   convergent denominators. ¬ß12a program item 3 lives here.
2. **¬ß9's Bishop-real work item requests convergents by
   description**: "a normalized-rational representation so kernel
   `decide` scales" ‚Äî convergents are the canonical normalized
   rationals, best approximations at minimal denominators by
   theorem.
3. **The odometer generalizes through Ostrowski/Zeckendorf
   numeration**: the Fibonacci odometer is the Bratteli‚ÄìVershik
   system of the golden substitution ‚Äî the canonical Pisot tiling
   dynamical system ‚Äî hinging the odometer wing to the
   aperiodic-order wing.
4. **Lagrange's periodicity theorem** (eventually periodic CF ‚ü∫
   quadratic irrational) is the arithmetic face of the
   periodicity/aperiodicity spine: the regime column in a number's
   digits.
5. **The Gauss map** (shift on CF expansions) carries an explicit
   invariant measure ‚Äî ¬ß8's next rung after the Bernoulli cylinder
   measure: a second, non-uniform, symmetry-forced measure.
6. Conjecture (this session): **Minkowski's question-mark function
   conjugates the CF world to the dyadic world** ‚Äî CF expansions to
