## 12g. New dots from re-reading the whole note (2026-07-11, prime session)

Connections that only appear with ¬ß¬ß1‚Äì12e and ¬ß12f on the table at
once. All readings/conjectures unless a declaration is cited.

1. **FTA says arithmetic is a Record.** `IsPrimeFactorization` exhibits
   (‚Ñï_{>0}, √ó) as the free commutative monoid on the primes ‚Äî a record
   carrier with one tally axis per prime (¬ß1's ‚Ñï√ó‚Ñï record generalized
   to the prime alphabet). Under this reading: the total tally Œ©(n)
   (number of prime factors with multiplicity) **is the record mass**;
   Œ©(mn) = Œ©(m) + Œ©(n) is `topMass_add`'s shape; the valuation vector
   n ‚Ü¶ (v_p(n))_p is the tropicalization of the integer ‚Äî `twoAdicVal`
   is the arithmetic instance of ¬ß1's dequantization hom, the library
   tropicalizing twice (logic: charge; arithmetic: valuation) with one
   semiring shape. Erd≈ës‚ÄìKac (the number of prime factors is
   asymptotically Gaussian) is then "record mass obeys a CLT," and
   ¬ß8.4 rank 3's digit-sum weak law is its exact finite model.
2. **The forgotten phase is the unit group.** 2-adic polar
   decomposition: every nonzero x ‚àà ‚Ñ§‚ÇÇ is 2^v ¬∑ u with u a unit ‚Äî
   valuation = the charge shadow, unit = the multiplicity the shadow
   forgets. ¬ß12e's inertia absence ("the record's counting
   multiplicity is the phase the charge forgets") and Collatz's
   generator (3 ‚àà ‚Ñ§‚ÇÇ^√ó, ¬ß12f) live in the same object: the unit part
   of the hull-as-ring. One carrier, two open programs.
3. **The archimedean place is ‚ä§.** ¬ß1 (‚ä§ = the point at infinity
   minted by bounding) and ¬ß8.2 (normalization is a compactification)
   are the same move arithmetic makes when it adjoins the infinite
   place to the finite primes. The product formula ‚àè_v |x|_v = 1 ‚Äî
   all places' prices multiply to one ‚Äî is arithmetic's conservation
   ledger across the valuation spectrum, and its structure (the
   archimedean price determined by all the p-adic ones) has the shape
   of ¬ß2's forced-readout uniqueness. The adele ring is the record
   carrier of arithmetic: one axis per place, ‚ä§ at infinity.
4. **p-adic L-functions are CylinderLaws** (far frontier; the deepest
   dot). The Iwasawa algebra ‚Ñ§_p[[Œì]] *is* the algebra of measures on
   the Galois group ‚Äî i.e., on the hull; a p-adic L-function is a
   finitely-additive measure on exactly the carrier where ¬ß8.1's
   `bernoulliLaw` now lives, and Kubota‚ÄìLeopoldt construct it from
   **Bernoulli distributions** (the name collision is not a
   collision: same hull, same construction family, the proved
   `bernoulliLaw` is the constant-coefficient case). The Iwasawa Main
   Conjecture ‚Äî characteristic ideal of a Galois-cohomology H¬π of the
   tower = the analytic measure ‚Äî is an obstruction-equals-analytic-
   mass exchange theorem: arithmetic's `landauer_cost_is_h1`, and the
   archetype of the mass-curvature exchange ¬ß7d still wants.
5. **The class group is the sixth H¬π.** Pic(O_K) = H¬π(Spec O_K, ùîæ_m):
   ideals modulo principal ideals ‚Äî a gauge-coset quotient in ¬ß4's
